At this point I cleared the quest levels bottom to top and went to wake up
Rodney.  Did the VS and verified no CM and "You feel lonely" from spell of
Detect Monster all the way back out of the DoD.

Killing all the inhabinants of the Plane of Water before teleporting out
took many turns.  All my pets, at this point 4 or 5 Nazgul and two Archons
popped through to Astral before me, and most became wild.  After retaming
the Archons I killed an adventurer and finally completed my +7 armor
ensemble with the +7 gloves of dex.  I then used confused ?CM and cursed
?Geno to fill the level.  This required taming of many acid blobs and orcs,
to surround the Archons with so they wouldn't keep killing what I wanted to
keep around for a while.

There's a trick in the extinctionist FAQ
(http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/extinctionist-faq.html) to really kill
Death, Famine, and Pesty Pestilence by filling the level with monsters so
their corpes have no square to regenerate to.  I finally felt "less
threatened" a few times thus removing the other horsemen from the game.  I
then offered the amulet to Ptah. (not my God).  But what did I know, being
atheist?

